OL,3,GNEWSAModel flying club soars again
OL,4,Aafter appeal on BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA model aircraft flying club that was
OL,7,Fgrounded when it was suddenly asked to
OL,8,Fleave its base by its landlord has
OL,9,Ffound a new home, following an appeal
OL,10,Fon the BBC.
OL,12,FDoddington Model Club was told it would
OL,13,Fneed to leave its site at RSPCA Block
OL,14,FFen in Cambridgeshire by the end of
OL,15,FOctober, due to "evolving operational
OL,16,Frequirements".
OL,18,FNeil Chapman put out a plea on BBC
OL,19,FRadio Cambridgeshire and online to
OL,20,Fanyone who could help, and March
OL,21,Fbusinessman Kevin Burke answered the
OL,22,Fcall.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
