OL,3,GNEWSAModel flying club soars again
OL,4,Aafter appeal on BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has given the group, which has been
OL,7,Frunning since 2012 and has 25 members,
OL,8,Fa runway area at a recently bought
OL,9,F38-acre (15.4 hectare) site. Chapman
OL,10,Fsaid the result "could not have gone
OL,11,Fany better".
